<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Still Launcher" pubkey="" timestamp="1794660513" url="https://yash244466666.github.io/still-launcher/repo" version="20002"><description>Signed releases of Still Launcher, an open-source text-first launcher for digital wellbeing.</description></repo><application id="org.stilllauncher"><id>org.stilllauncher</id><added>2026-11-14</added><lastupdated>2026-11-14</lastupdated><name>Still Launcher</name><summary>A text-first launcher for digital wellbeing</summary><desc>Still Launcher replaces the home-screen icon grid with a short list of names,
a clock and a small set of tools you switch on deliberately.

Features include an alphabetical app list with a drag/tap index bar, a Recent
apps section, favourites and folders, timed app blocking, recurring focus
schedules, daily app limits, a home-screen background-app shortcut, screen-time
statistics, themes and gesture settings.

Optional focus tools use Android's usage-access, accessibility and notification
access. All data stays on the device. The app has no INTERNET permission, no
accounts, no ads and no analytics.

Accessibility is used only to detect the current foreground app and optional
short-video view IDs. Notification access is used only for the local allow-list
filter. Per-app grayscale additionally requires a one-time adb grant of
WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS and is entirely optional.

This repository is an independent clean-room project. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by or derived from any commercial launcher.</desc><license>GPL-3.0-or-later</license><categories>Launcher,System</categories><category>Launcher</category><web>https://github.com/yash244466666/still-launcher</web><source>https://github.com/yash244466666/still-launcher</source><tracker>https://github.com/yash244466666/still-launcher/issues</tracker><changelog>https://github.com/yash244466666/still-launcher/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</changelog><author>Still Launcher contributors</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>100303</marketvercode><package><version>0.3.3</version><versioncode>100303</versioncode><apkname>still-launcher-0.3.3-release.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">5f4960cb911dc5024fe31bfc3b3328c2a5763c75ec2a3ff39da979c514b5f296</hash><size>2800096</size><sdkver>32</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-14</added><sig>780394203a8975126dc2d6d77813ac27</sig><permissions>EXPAND_STATUS_BAR,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW,VIBRATE,WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS,org.stilllauncher.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.3.2</version><versioncode>100302</versioncode><apkname>still-launcher-0.3.2-release.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">70ae179e189243a3ff625b868ebfd8d0446b84c97160fc148e17fb43672bad3b</hash><size>2800184</size><sdkver>32</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-14</added><sig>780394203a8975126dc2d6d77813ac27</sig><permissions>EXPAND_STATUS_BAR,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW,VIBRATE,WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS,org.stilllauncher.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.3.1</version><versioncode>100301</versi